#   1 payload   extract the byte-identical committed sources, verify every sha256 against the embedded manifest (phys2.py and select2.py also against the selection kernel's)
#   2 venv      Python 3.12 venv in /tmp with the SAME package versions as round 1 (uv)
#   3 git       throw-away repo so ct2/final2.py's clean-tree guard passes; git tree hashes of ct/ (round-1 tree) and ct2/ and the blobs of freeze and pre-registration must match
