#   5 final     ct2/final2.py: ten train-only fits in a 4-worker pool, gate on the seed-0 train RMSE (against the selection kernel's dry run), then ONE scored test run per seed
#               (rows in TEST-LOG-CT2.md); never repeated
#   6 compare / plots / aggregate / edge: each in its own try/except; final is never re-run if one of them fails
